{
    "title": "One State RP - Role Play Life",
    "description": "OneState is the great roleplay game with an open world and 500+ people online in one map! Choose your own path in OneState!\r\nOneState RP offers a realistic and immersive real life simulator, where every decision you make has consequences. Customize your character, build relationships, and shape your own destiny in this ever-evolving open world life simulator. Upgrade your cars, acquire new vehicles, and compete in thrilling car racing events against skilled opponents. Show off your drifting skills and master the art of high speed racing in this realistic car racing experience.\r\nImmerse yourself in the ultimate roleplay experience with One State RP, a real life simulator set in a vast open world. Join the police force, enforce the law, and protect the city from criminals or join the gang \u0430nd become a real gangster! If both of these roles are not for you, you can become a serious military man or even an ordinary hard worker in the service of society!\r\nExperience the adrenaline-pumping action of shooting, crime, and police pursuits in this action packed open world roleplay game. One State RP combines all these elements to deliver an unparalleled gaming experience where you can truly live your roleplay fantasies.\r\n\r\nDownload One State RP now and embark on a journey where you can live out your wildest roleplay fantasies in an open world full of opportunities and challenges. Are you ready to carve your path to success and you love rp games? The choice is yours. Experience the ultimate real life simulator with OneState RP.",
    "descriptionHTML": "OneState is the great roleplay game with an open world and 500+ people online in one map! Choose your own path in OneState!<br>OneState RP offers a realistic and immersive real life simulator, where every decision you make has consequences. Customize your character, build relationships, and shape your own destiny in this ever-evolving open world life simulator. Upgrade your cars, acquire new vehicles, and compete in thrilling car racing events against skilled opponents. Show off your drifting skills and master the art of high speed racing in this realistic car racing experience.<br>Immerse yourself in the ultimate roleplay experience with One State RP, a real life simulator set in a vast open world. Join the police force, enforce the law, and protect the city from criminals or join the gang \u0430nd become a real gangster! If both of these roles are not for you, you can become a serious military man or even an ordinary hard worker in the service of society!<br>Experience the adrenaline-pumping action of shooting, crime, and police pursuits in this action packed open world roleplay game. One State RP combines all these elements to deliver an unparalleled gaming experience where you can truly live your roleplay fantasies.<br><br>Download One State RP now and embark on a journey where you can live out your wildest roleplay fantasies in an open world full of opportunities and challenges. Are you ready to carve your path to success and you love rp games? The choice is yours. Experience the ultimate real life simulator with OneState RP.",
    "summary": "Dive into the real RP life simulator! Car, racing & gangs in the big city online",
